{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41891","headline":"海城秋日书怀寄朐山孙明府 · 李中","name":"海城秋日书怀寄朐山孙明府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"槐柳蝉声起渡头，海城孤客思悠悠。\n青云展志知何日，皓月牵吟又入秋。\n监里渐生潘岳鬓，风前犹着卜商裘。\n鸣琴良宰挥毫士，应笑蹉跎身未酬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41891.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41891","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}